xt-decoration:underline">and</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"> </font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">Administration</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">. Have discretionary authority to&#58;</font></div><div><font><br></font></div><div style="margin-top:0.05pt;padding-right:17.9pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:72pt"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(i)&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">Interpret</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">. Interpret and construe all provisions of this instrument (including resolving an inconsistency or ambiguity or correcting an error or an omission)&#59;</font></div><div style="margin-top:13.75pt;padding-right:17.7pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:72pt"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(ii)&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">Administer</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">. Administer the plan in accordance with its terms and provisions&#59; and</font></div><div style="margin-top:3.05pt;padding-right:17.75pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:72pt"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(iii)&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-