00;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">Third</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"> </font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">Amendment</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">. The Employer amended the plan on August 28, 2024, to authorize a limited lump sum opportunity to certain participants, effective September 1, 2024.</font></div><div><font><br></font></div><div style="padding-right:17.7pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(h)&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">Third</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"> </font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">Pre-Approved</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"> </font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">Cycle</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">. In accordance with Revenue Procedure 2016-37 and Announcement 2023-6, the Employer amended and restated the plan during the third six-year cycle applicable to the WNJ pre-approved defined benefit plan to comply with the requirements set forth in Notice 2020-14 (the 2020 Cumulative List), effective January 1, 2025.</font></di